 ## Stack
 
 - `index.html` — static frontend, vanilla JS
+- `demo/sample-trip.js` — offline Lisbon trip for local / Cursor demos (no API key)
 - `netlify/functions/plan.js` — serverless function that calls the Anthropic API
 - Deploys automatically to Netlify on every push to `main`
 
+## Campus / startup-club demo
+
+Step-by-step 15-minute Cursor walkthrough (models, Agent, Cmd+K, skills, Cloud Agents): **[DEMO_SCRIPT.md](DEMO_SCRIPT.md)**.
+
+```bash
+npx --yes serve . -p 5173
+# open http://localhost:5173 → "Open the Lisbon demo trip"
+```
+
 ## Setup
 
 The Anthropic API key lives **only** in Netlify environment variables (`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`) — never in this repo.
+Backend (Supabase, Maps, waitlist): **[SETUP.md](SETUP.md)**.
